{"4011300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Shout Showdown", "steam_appid": 4011300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/ee026fde7ad0962f046fa1df1dec6a5b.poster.avif?t=1786086534\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/ee026fde7ad0962f046fa1df1dec6a5b.webm?t=1786086534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/ee026fde7ad0962f046fa1df1dec6a5b.mp4?t=1786086534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover over 100 unique spells. Launch massive energy blasts, teleport across the field, strike with powerful blows, or unleash devastating ultimate attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn foes with fire, freeze them with ice, or blind them with darkness. Experiment, combine, and master them to create your own fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/a7d0632d22e9160f4abd873ca7744ec0.poster.avif?t=1786086534\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/a7d0632d22e9160f4abd873ca7744ec0.webm?t=1786086534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/a7d0632d22e9160f4abd873ca7744ec0.mp4?t=1786086534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your spell chants and make every cast truly your own. Go full anime or full nonsense. We won’t judge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/a9d80fecabd717b0b149d330bae5c7b6.poster.avif?t=1786086534\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/a9d80fecabd717b0b149d330bae5c7b6.webm?t=1786086534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/a9d80fecabd717b0b149d330bae5c7b6.mp4?t=1786086534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shouting Mode</strong> - Cast spells using your real voice to unleash even greater magic. <br>Just like in the anime!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typing Mode </strong>- No voice? No problem. Type your incantations and unleash the magic in the heat of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tapping Mode</strong> - Using a mouse or controller? Focus on timing and strike at the perfect moment to cast your spell.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/b3c6dfe84055fdad2e3b4855e2cf3fcf.poster.avif?t=1786086534\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/b3c6dfe84055fdad2e3b4855e2cf3fcf.webm?t=1786086534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/b3c6dfe84055fdad2e3b4855e2cf3fcf.mp4?t=1786086534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duel </strong>– Fight another player in a one-on-one battle to decide who is the strongest spellcaster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Battle</strong> – Fight as a team, combo your spells, work together to gain victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-for-All</strong> – Fight with up to 16 players in one big map where danger might comes from every direction</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/ee026fde7ad0962f046fa1df1dec6a5b.poster.avif?t=1786086534\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/ee026fde7ad0962f046fa1df1dec6a5b.webm?t=1786086534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/ee026fde7ad0962f046fa1df1dec6a5b.mp4?t=1786086534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover over 100 unique spells. Launch massive energy blasts, teleport across the field, strike with powerful blows, or unleash devastating ultimate attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn foes with fire, freeze them with ice, or blind them with darkness. Experiment, combine, and master them to create your own fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/a7d0632d22e9160f4abd873ca7744ec0.poster.avif?t=1786086534\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/a7d0632d22e9160f4abd873ca7744ec0.webm?t=1786086534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/a7d0632d22e9160f4abd873ca7744ec0.mp4?t=1786086534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your spell chants and make every cast truly your own. Go full anime or full nonsense. We won’t judge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/a9d80fecabd717b0b149d330bae5c7b6.poster.avif?t=1786086534\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/a9d80fecabd717b0b149d330bae5c7b6.webm?t=1786086534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/a9d80fecabd717b0b149d330bae5c7b6.mp4?t=1786086534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shouting Mode</strong> - Cast spells using your real voice to unleash even greater magic. <br>Just like in the anime!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typing Mode </strong>- No voice? No problem. Type your incantations and unleash the magic in the heat of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tapping Mode</strong> - Using a mouse or controller? Focus on timing and strike at the perfect moment to cast your spell.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/b3c6dfe84055fdad2e3b4855e2cf3fcf.poster.avif?t=1786086534\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/b3c6dfe84055fdad2e3b4855e2cf3fcf.webm?t=1786086534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011300/extras/b3c6dfe84055fdad2e3b4855e2cf3fcf.mp4?t=1786086534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duel </strong>– Fight anoth